    <text><list><item>Medication: continued without change, Acetaminophen 500 mg oral tablet, two tablets by mouth as needed for headache, no more than 2 days a week [S]</item><item>Medication: started, Candesartan 8 mg oral tablet, one tablet by mouth daily [S]</item><item>Goal: Stop daily over-the-counter analgesics and limit acute headache medicine to no more than 2 days a week. In progress; target 2026-05-18 [S]</item><item>Goal: Cut headache days by at least half by the three-month review. In progress; target 2026-08-17 [S]</item><item>Goal: Reduce daytime sleep attacks and lower the PROMIS sleep-related impairment T-score below 60. In progress; target 2026-08-17 [S]</item><item>Goal: Establish whether the spells are epileptic before considering antiseizure medicine. In progress; target 2026-05-18 [S]</item><item>Continue the care plan agreed on 2026-04-06 [S]</item><item>Next visit 2026-05-18: review of ambulatory EEG and sleep studies; four-week headache check [S]</item></list></text>

